<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">For the 1 in 9 American adults on a GLP-1</span>
      <h1>Lose the weight. <span>Keep</span> the muscle. <span>Keep</span> the results.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Kept is the daily companion for Zepbound, Wegovy, Foundayo and other GLP-1 medicines: dose reminders and site rotation, a side-effect coach that knows your dose schedule, protein and strength targets that protect your muscle — and an off-ramp plan so the weight stays off.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#waitlist">Join the waitlist</a>
        <%= button_to "Try the live demo", demo_session_path, class: "btn btn-ghost" %>
      </div>
      <div class="trust"><span>Built on prescribing information & 2025 nutrition guidance</span><span>Never sells your data</span><span>Works with any prescriber</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="phone" aria-label="Kept app preview" role="img">
      <div class="phone-screen">
        <div class="mini-row"><strong>Today</strong><span class="small muted">Week 22 · Zepbound</span></div>
        <div class="card dose-card"><div class="small muted">Thursday dose</div><div style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800">10 mg due today</div>
          <div class="mini-row" style="margin-top:8px"><span class="small muted">Next site: left arm</span><span class="btn btn-accent btn-sm">Log injection</span></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="rings">
          <%= ring 74, 98, label: "74 g", sub: "of 98 g protein", size: 92 %>
          <%= ring 1750, 3300, label: "1.8 L", sub: "of 3.3 L water", size: 92, color: "var(--water)" %>
          <%= ring 2, 3, label: "2/3", sub: "lifts this week", size: 92, color: "var(--lift)" %>
        </div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="mini-row"><strong>Muscle protection</strong><%= status_badge :good, "85/100" %></div>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin:6px 0 0">≈ 16% of your loss is lean mass. Keep the protein and the lifting going.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="mini-row"><strong>Side-effect pattern</strong><span class="small muted">last 60 days</span></div>
          <p class="small" style="margin:6px 0 0">Nausea peaks 1 day after your dose. Plan lighter, lower-fat meals for that window.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="mini-row"><strong>Down 14.2%</strong><span class="small muted">0.8% a week lately</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band alt" aria-labelledby="why-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><span class="eyebrow">The problem</span><h2 id="why-h">The medicine works. What happens around it decides whether the results last.</h2></div>
    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact"><div class="n">11%</div><p>of US adults now take a GLP-1 for weight loss — up from 3% in 2024.</p><a href="https://kffhealthnews.org/morning-breakout/pharma-and-tech-070826/">Gallup via KFF Health News, 2026</a></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="n">65%</div><p>of people without diabetes stop within 12 months — side effects, cost and plateaus.</p><a href="https://uspharmacist.com/article/weight-regain-common-after-stopping-glp1-drugs">125,474-adult cohort, 2025</a></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="n">~60%</div><p>of the weight lost returns within a year of stopping without a plan.</p><a href="https://www.doctors.net.uk/news/patients-regain-60-of-weight-lost-on-glp-1-drugs-within-a-year-of-stopping">Meta-analysis of 48 studies, 2026</a></div>
      <div class="fact"><div class="n">up to 40%</div><p>of the weight lost can be muscle without enough protein and strength training.</p><a href="<%= science_path %>">The science</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="gap-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><span class="eyebrow">What your prescription doesn’t come with</span><h2 id="gap-h">Four things Kept adds to every dose.</h2></div>
    <div class="gaps">
      <div class="card gap"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--accent-soft)">♡</div><h3>A side-effect plan</h3><p class="muted">A coach that knows which day after your dose symptoms peak, what helps, and the red flags that mean call someone now.</p></div>
      <div class="card gap"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--brand-soft)">◍</div><h3>Protein & strength targets</h3><p class="muted">1.2–1.6 g/kg of protein and three short lifting sessions a week — the evidence-backed way to keep muscle while you lose fat.</p></div>
      <div class="card gap"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--water-soft)">✚</div><h3>A dose system</h3><p class="muted">Reminders, site rotation, missed-dose rules from the label, and when the dose ladder says it’s time to ask about the next step.</p></div>
      <div class="card gap"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--lift-soft)">⇢</div><h3>An off-ramp</h3><p class="muted">Maintenance dose, taper or stop — planned with your prescriber, with a regain guardrail that catches drift early.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band alt" id="features" aria-labelledby="feat-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><span class="eyebrow">Everything in one app</span><h2 id="feat-h">Built for real life on a GLP-1.</h2></div>
    <div class="features">
      <% [["Smart dose log", "Weekly or daily, injection or pill. Site rotation, adherence and missed-dose guidance per your medicine’s label."],
          ["Side-effect coach", "Log nausea, reflux or constipation in two taps; get advice timed to your dose cycle and red-flag triage."],
          ["Protein-first food log", "Quick-add high-protein foods that are easy on a small appetite. Fiber and water tracked alongside."],
          ["Strength program", "Three 40-minute full-body sessions a week, gym or home, that progress with you."],
          ["Muscle protection score", "Estimates how much of your loss is lean mass from your medicine, protein and training — or from your smart scale."],
          ["Weight trend, not noise", "A smoothed trend that ignores water swings, flags losing too fast, plateaus and early regain."],
          ["Cost finder", "Savings cards, Medicare’s $50 program, direct cash prices and cheaper approved alternatives — compared monthly."],
          ["Doctor-ready report", "One printable page: doses, adherence, side effects, weight, protein and questions to ask."],
          ["Coverage appeal draft", "A letter of medical necessity built from your logs for your prescriber to edit and send."]].each do |t, d| %>
        <article class="card feature"><h3><%= t %></h3><p><%= d %></p></article>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

