</section>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="safe-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="safety">
      <span class="eyebrow">Safety & privacy</span>
      <h2 id="safe-h">A companion, not a prescriber.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Dose guidance comes straight from prescribing information; dose changes are always your clinician’s decision.</li>
        <li>Red-flag symptoms (pancreatitis, gallbladder, dehydration, allergic reactions) trigger clear “seek care” guidance.</li>
        <li>No compounded-drug sales, no supplements pushed, no data sold — ever.</li>
        <li>Employers see de-identified totals for groups of 10 or more. Never your name, never your logs.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band alt" aria-labelledby="price-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span><h2 id="price-h">Free to start. Plus when you want the full program.</h2></div>
    <div class="prices">
      <div class="card price-card"><h3>Free</h3><div class="p">$0</div><ul><li>Dose log, reminders & site rotation</li><li>Side-effect coach with red flags</li><li>Weight trend</li><li>Protein & water targets</li></ul></div>
