      <span class="eyebrow">Early access</span>
      <h2 id="wl-h">iPhone and Android apps open in waves.</h2>
      <p class="muted">The web app is live today. Join the list for the mobile apps with reminders on your lock screen — and move up five places for every friend who joins with your link.</p>
      <% if @count.to_i >= 100 %><p class="small muted"><%= number_with_delimiter(@count.to_i.floor(-2)) %>+ people on the list.</p><% end %>
    </div>
    <%= render "pages/waitlist_form", signup: @signup %>
  </div>
</section>
